WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.488 --> 00:00:04.155
(speaking foreign language)

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.293
- It's really special to see

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.493
the black rhino.

00:00:37.488 --> 00:00:39.439
Since we started here we have seen

00:00:39.439 --> 00:00:41.106
only six rhino here.

00:00:44.448 --> 00:00:47.659
They from Maasai Mara, Kenya.

00:00:47.659 --> 00:00:48.492
See it?

00:00:49.608 --> 00:00:51.240
So they used to cross the river

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.549
and they come this area here

00:00:52.549 --> 00:00:55.989
because nowaday Maasai Mara looks crowded.

00:00:55.989 --> 00:00:58.120
They say that they
destroyed their habitats.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.120
That's why they're coming this side.

00:01:03.419 --> 00:01:04.440
Have a look at the ears.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:07.379
You could see they have a notch, you see?

00:01:07.379 --> 00:01:09.796
That's how to identify these.

00:01:12.149 --> 00:01:16.779
Before it's estimated
that there are 2000 rhinos

00:01:16.779 --> 00:01:20.128
in that area, but nowaday
there's just a few

00:01:20.128 --> 00:01:22.545
because of the poachers here.

00:01:25.768 --> 00:01:28.920
Now they are endangered species.

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:31.503
(somber music)

